      "id": "claim_6106bed4b06244babe2e9ec7160f771d",
      "statement": "Effective 2026-06-29, SEC Order IA-7104 adjusts Rule 205-3's qualified-client tests to at least $1.4 million of adviser-managed assets immediately after contract entry or net worth greater than $2.7 million immediately before contract entry; the firm's eligibility guide implements Order Q.2 rather than replacing it with an independently operative restatement.",
      "evidence": [
