      "statement": "Order IA-7104 adjusts only Rule 205-3 qualified-client dollar tests, leaving Regulation D accredited-investor criteria and the Investment Company Act qualified-purchaser definition unchanged; accredited-investor status is determined separately, and eligibility must be checked against the status required by the strategy or offering.",
